id=taptoshare_enable
name=Quick Share Tap to share enabler
version=v0.0
versionCode=0
author=deang
description=Enables Quick Share Tap to share on Galaxy phones with NFC. Mounts Quick Share 13.9.02.22 (newer builds hardcode the feature off; you provide the APK) in memory over the built-in app, sets the flags it checks, and lowers the Play services minimum Quick Share version for the NFC tap. Nothing written to /system.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nessuno6/TapToShare-Enabler/main/update.json
